(7784254, 1295551, 30861, '<td valign="top">
While it''s true that the two trucks are centered on the 1/3 verticals, more or less, and their bumpers occupy the 1/3 horizontal area, this doesn''t read as a ROT composition, but rather as a centered and symmetrical composition. As much as anything, this is due to the central pillar and the way the FIRE logos define the horizontal center line.
<br/>
<br/>It is a striking image regardless :-) Well seen.</td>', 'While it''s true that the two trucks are centered on the 1/3 verticals, more or less, and their bumpers occupy the 1/3 horizontal area, this doesn''t read as a ROT composition, but rather as a centered and symmetrical composition. As much as anything, this is due to the central pillar and the way the FIRE logos define the horizontal center line.

It is a striking image regardless :-) Well seen.', '2025-07-09 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
